{"title":"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given a triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> as the right angle, and the sidelengths of the triangle are integers.  Determine the possible side lengths of the triangle if the product of the legs of the right triangle equals to three times the perimeter of the triangle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be the legs of the triangle.  We can express the comparison as an equation.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa99fa0563c57a9bdb71f6c2d6cb2996df1e7438.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ab = 3(a+b+\\sqrt{a^2 + b^2})\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"21\" />\nWe can manipulate the equation to find a relationship between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/6583a799ce46b06b1cceb493abb45a07c88fd6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b.$\" width=\"11\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/7/03775e3a12a65266c72ecafc9b121a0d7b9ca05b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} ab-3(a+b) &amp;= 3\\sqrt{a^2 + b^2} \\\\ a^2b^2 - 6a^2b - 6ab^2 + 9a^2 + 18ab + 9b^2 &amp;= 9a^2 + 9b^2 \\\\ a^2b^2 - 6a^2b - 6ab^2 + 18ab &amp;= 0 \\end{align*}\" width=\"400\" height=\"73\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/4/07442ccce4d822965d39e7f377f5cb2561e5d3d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab \\ne 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" /> we can divide both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> without affecting the solution.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/9/0c98b9d794e4422738e7c3f5cabec1e9e3c4561b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ab-6a-6b+18 = 0\\]\" width=\"170\" height=\"14\" />\nWe can use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simon%27s_Favorite_Factoring_Trick\" title=\"Simon&#39;s Favorite Factoring Trick\">Simon's Favorite Factoring Trick</a> to find integral solutions.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/f/3cf182afacea4bb5e8dd04e38533a9d9a9cc39de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a-6)(b-6) =18\\]\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />\nFrom the equation, we find that the three possible triangles can have the following side lengths: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/995d5b3a26e7dc1fbe88d449aaf987bd08761402.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(7,24,25), (8,15,17), (9,12,15)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"258\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO\">2003 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202531\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 101/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1006/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 58/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2391/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.477      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    7.477      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16628:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202531 and revision id 219482. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}